WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
I bid on the renovation and rebuilding

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.840
of this very United Nations complex.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.840
I remember it so well.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.000
I said at the time that I would do it for $500 million,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
rebuilding everything.

